From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Quinlan <mjquinlan2000@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:13:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] port: asset swap hooks


diff --git a/src/bonus/0_controller.c b/src/bonus/0_controller.c
index 2a4e56d..e1f257e 100644
--- a/src/bonus/0_controller.c
